  "id": "mexican-shrimp-and-scallop-ceviche",
  "name": "Mexican Shrimp and Scallop Ceviche",
  "subtitle": "Citrus-marinated seafood with crisp vegetables and fresh peppers",
  "description": "Shrimp and scallops are marinated in citrus, then combined with chopped vegetables, cilantro, olive oil, and seasonings for a chilled ceviche.",
